- camel/agents/mcp_agent.py
  - Classes: MCPAgent (specialized ChatAgent integrating MCP tools, supports async connect/disconnect, tool calls, and function calling)
- camel/toolkits/mcp_toolkit.py
  - Classes: MCPToolkit (manages multiple MCPClient connections, provides unified tool interface, supports async context management, tool schema enforcement, tool calling, and connection lifecycle)

